# The build context of the Node images (migrate, api and web), of the
# collector validator (otelcol-validator) and of the collector tester
# (otelcol-testing) is the repository's root so that their images can carry
# catalog/, the collector catalogue. This file is an allowlist: only the
# workspace, the catalogue, the install templates (the API image's default
# set), the two Python services' directories and one file of vendor/ go in.
# Everything else stays out: .git, docs/, docker/ (the tester's and the
# evaluator's development secrets among it), the rest of vendor/ (the
# opamp-server's contract files), the other services (the OTTL evaluator
# builds from its own context, with its own .dockerignore; the opamp-server,
# in its own repository, runs its published image) and scratch files. Each
# Python service's directory goes in whole but for what Python leaves
# behind: its tests are needed by its Dockerfile's `test` target, and its
# runtime stage copies only what the service runs (app/, telemetry.py, the
# runtime lock; the tester's kwok configuration and seed too), so the tests
# never reach a runtime image. The tester's image also reads the validator's
# downloader (scripts/download-binaries.py). The one vendor/ file let in is
# the opamp-server's org-token corpus, which the validator's `test` target
# copies for tests/test_org_variables.py; no runtime stage copies it.
*
!telflo-core/
!catalog/
!install-templates/
!services/otelcol-validator/
!services/otelcol-testing/
!vendor/opamp-server/org-token-corpus.json

# Within the workspace, keep the context to source: nothing installed, built
# or secret.
telflo-core/**/node_modules
telflo-core/**/dist
telflo-core/**/build
telflo-core/**/.react-router
telflo-core/**/*.tsbuildinfo
telflo-core/coverage
# Every package's too: the web dev server reads apps/web/.env.
telflo-core/**/.env
telflo-core/**/.env.*
!telflo-core/.env.example
# The browser tests: never part of an image.
telflo-core/e2e
telflo-core/playwright.config.ts
telflo-core/test-results
telflo-core/playwright-report
# The fake OIDC provider and other test support: never part of an image.
telflo-core/apps/api/src/testing

# Within the validator's directory: no virtual environment, bytecode, test
# cache or local secret.
services/otelcol-validator/**/.venv
services/otelcol-validator/**/__pycache__
services/otelcol-validator/**/*.py[cod]
services/otelcol-validator/**/.pytest_cache
services/otelcol-validator/**/.env
services/otelcol-validator/**/.env.*

# Within the tester's directory, the same.
services/otelcol-testing/**/.venv
services/otelcol-testing/**/__pycache__
services/otelcol-testing/**/*.py[cod]
services/otelcol-testing/**/.pytest_cache
services/otelcol-testing/**/.env
services/otelcol-testing/**/.env.*
